# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A thin [[membrane]] that lines the [[ligamentous]] surfaces of {{w|joint capsule}}s, {{w|tendon sheath}}s where free movement is necessary, and [[bursa]]e; it is composed of dense [[connective tissue]] and secretes [[synovial fluid]].

